    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786560/extras/3b23af64617d058026e16a8406554ac4.avif?t=1754547831\" data-has-big width=800 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the treehouse village inhabited by cats and pandas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They love to play, climb and hide and seek here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden Cats &amp; Pandas is a hidden object game. The player's task is to find all the cats and pandas that are hidden in different parts of the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 300 creatures to find - kittens and pandas and hidden stars.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786560/extras/3b23af64617d058026e16a8406554ac4.avif?t=1754547831\" data-has-big width=800 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the treehouse village inhabited by cats and pandas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They love to play, climb and hide and seek here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden Cats &amp; Pandas is a hidden object game. The player's task is to find all the cats and pandas that are hidden in different parts of the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 300 creatures to find - kittens and pandas and hidden stars.</p>",
